#. i18n: file: timerui.ui:44
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSlider, kcfg_MissedTimer)
#. +> trunk stable
#: rc.cpp:145
msgid "You can set the time for displaying the \"Already Guessed\" tooltip after you tried a letter that was already guessed. Default is 1 second but younger children might need longer time to be able to understand they are trying a letter that was already guessed."
msgstr "Du kannst de Wiestiet för de \"Al raadt\"-Mellen fastleggen. Se warrt wiest, wenn Du en Bookstaav utprobeerst, den Du vördem al raadt harrst. De Standard is 1 Sekunn, man lütter Kinner bruukt sachs wat länger, ehr se begrepen hebbt, se probeert en Bookstaav ut, de al raadt wöör."

